[rel('practice','Explains practical improvisation through embodied dispositions and the social power of classification.',['bourdieu_outline_primary'],'Reuses prior primary review of Nice foreword vii–viii and selected author pp. 1–2, 72–74, 79, 164–165. Habitus permits unforeseen activity; French original/full book remain unread and uncollated.'),rel('biography','Questions retrospectively unified life narratives and reconstructs trajectories through changing social fields.',['bourdieu_biographical_illusion'],'Retained complete four-page primary review, pp. 69–72/eight notes, including institutional naming and interview conditions. A critique of naturalized narrative coherence, not rejection of every life history or all agency.'),rel('consumption','Examines how tastes and classificatory judgments relate to social position and struggles over legitimacy.',['distinction'],'Retained selected primary transcription presented as selections from pp. 466–484 of Nice’s 1984 translation, not the entire printed conclusion or book. No new statistical check, field-wide reception or universal class law.')],
